==Introduction==

[[File:en/Manual/OpenttdLogo.png|left|130px]]
Step up as the President of a start-up transportation company in the 1950's, try to connect various industries and cities with a varied choice of rail, road, air and maritime vehicles and build up your own transportation empire!

Outsmart your competition, beat rival companies to service profitable routes, and race them to become the largest transport company by the year 2050!

[http://www.openttd.org/ OpenTTD] is an [https://www.wikipedia.org/wiki/Open%20source open source] reimplementation of the game [https://www.wikipedia.org/wiki/Transport_Tycoon Transport Tycoon Deluxe (TTD)] by [https://www.wikipedia.org/wiki/MicroProse Microprose] and originally coded by [http://www.chrissawyer.com/info.htm Chris Sawyer]. It introduces a rich set of new features, including multiplayer support, improved stations and vehicles, larger maps and a host of other options.

OpenTTD can be run on Windows, macOS, Linux, Unix and a few other [https://github.com/OpenTTD/OpenTTD/blob/master/README.md#13-supported-platforms supported platforms].

